        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sd3c",
          "text": "At Dormer Harpring, we have the knowledge, insight, and skills necessary to face large companies and corporate lawyers. We will protect your rights at every phase of your product liability case. Our Denver product liability attorneys can resolve even the most complex product liability cases through a settlement negotiation or civil court proceeding and trial.",
