      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bd6l",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sd6k",
          "text": "Consulting a Denver product liability lawyer is an important first step in understanding whether you qualify for compensation and any other options you may have for recovery. Our attorneys can also recommend medical providers and other accident-related services. We offer clients more than excellent representation; we also provide free consultations, cost payment options, and prompt, responsive attorneys.",
